    "title": "Former St. Joseph Catholic Academy athlete Katelyn Vitkus on UW-Stevens Point roster for week ending Sept. 6",
    "text": "Former St. Joseph Catholic Academy athlete Katelyn Vitkus on UW-Stevens Point roster for week ending Sept. 6\nBy\nK. M. PaceKatelyn Vitkus, a former St. Joseph Catholic Academy athlete, appears on the UW-Stevens Point women’s soccer roster for the week ending Sept. 6, when the team is scheduled to host St. Catherine University on Sept. 1.\nThe schedule shows three UW-Stevens Point women’s soccer events for Vitkus during the week ending Sept. 6.\nVitkus is listed for matches with UW-Stevens Point against St. Catherine University on Sept. 1 and Concordia University (Wis.) on Sept. 6 in Stevens Point, Wisconsin, and an away event against Bethel University on Sept. 4 in St. Paul, Minnesota.",
